    <briefdescription>
<para>Iterator over Functions, optionally filtered to a single file. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When filtering to a single file, the iterator requires a list of potential indices where to find the desired records to avoid quadratic behavior when repeatedly iterating over functions from different files. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
